  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Job answered and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How hast thou helped",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "without power?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "how",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "savest thou the arm",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that hath",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no strength?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How hast thou counselled",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him that hath",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no wisdom? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "how",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hast thou plentifully declared the thing as it is?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To whom hast thou uttered words? and whose spirit came from thee?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dead",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are formed from under the waters, and the inhabitants thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hell",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naked before him, and destruction hath no covering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He stretcheth out the north over the empty place,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hangeth the earth upon nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He bindeth up the waters in his thick clouds; and the cloud is not rent under them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He holdeth back the face of his throne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spreadeth his cloud upon it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath compassed the waters with bounds, until the day and night come to an end.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The pillars of heaven tremble and are astonished at his reproof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He divideth the sea with his power, and by his understanding he smiteth through the proud.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By his spirit he hath garnished the heavens; his hand hath formed the crooked serpent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.26.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.26.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "parts of his ways: but how little a portion is heard of him? but the thunder of his power who can understand?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
